 "caption": "The one section the page leans on: its whole feature stands in one raised frame, with the section's band flat. The section is a DSSectionContainer at size LG, color BASE, and inside it one DSFeature whose surface is the frame, color DEFAULT, raised, elevation LG, rounded, so it stands off its band as a door's box does. What stands inside is flat, the picture included, so there is one frame and the picture takes no frame of its own. From a tablet up it splits as SPLIT_END does: the words at the start with the head packed as one block, two points as a LIST and one action; the picture at the end, as mediaNode, in the shape it is made in. On a phone the words come first, then the points, then the picture. The design language sets the form, a stage or open, and the Highlight test allows one on a page besides the closing call, never on the hero and never two in a row. The page that holds this section is wrapped once in DSSitePage.",
